diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index f68faefd94a95f991cc62c3ab64078fd87a3c896..7a8b7b4d1c77a5b7773cb785d7cc5a16bc6276c8 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -8,4 +8,10 @@ from `src/index.ts`.
 Every task has an id, which no other task of the list has and which stays the same when the task is
 renamed. `get(id)` returns a task by its id, and the methods that take a title also accept the id.
 
+Every task also records when it was added (`createdAt`) and when it last changed (`updatedAt`), both as
+ISO-8601 date-times. A new task has the same time in both. Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or
+untagging a task sets `updatedAt` to the time of that change; a refused change leaves both times as they
+were. The list reads the time from the clock given to `createTodoList(clock)`, which defaults to the system
+clock, so tests can pass a fixed clock.
+
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
